          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መከራ ፡ እየተቀበሉ ፡ ነው ፡ ኋላም ፡ ክታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብ ፡ ጽፈው ፡ ሲሰዱላቸው ፡ ይህ ፡ ሁሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንጅ ፡ ለኛ ፡ ብለው ፡ ነው ፡ ብለው ፡ ደስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይላቸዋልና ። አንድም ፡ ትፍሥሕትነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፍጽምተ ፡ ትኩን ፡ ብክሙ ፡ ተድላ ፡ ደስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታችን ፡ በናንተ ፡ ፍጹም ፡ ትሆን ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀድሞ ፡ ሲማሩላቸው ፡ ሲያምኑላቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲጠመቁላቸው ፡ ኋላም ፡ ክታብ ፡ ጽፈ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ፡ ሰደውላቸው ፡ ሲቀበሏቸው ፡ ደስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይላቸዋልና ፡ ትኩኑ ፡ ሱታፌ ፡ ምስሌነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወሱታፌነሰ ፡ ምስለ ፡ አብ ፡ ላለው ፡ አመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጣ ፡ ዮሐ ፡ ፲፭ ፥ ፲፩ና ፡ ፲፮ ፥ ፳፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": "፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፭ ፤ ወዛቲ ፡ ይእቲ ፡ ዜና ፡ እንተ ፡ ሰማዕናሃ ፡ ትካት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እምኔሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህችም፡ በጥንተ፡ ስብከት ፡ ከእሱ ፡ የሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማናት ፡ ትምህርት ፡ ናት ፤ (ትኩኑ ፡ ሱታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፌ ፡ ምስሌነ ፡ ብሎ ፡ ነበረና ፡ ከመ ፡ ይኩ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኑ ፡ አሐደ ፡ ብነ ፡ ከማነ፡ዘኪያክሙ ፡ ተወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክፈ ፡ ኪያየ ፡ ተወክፈ ፡ ሲል ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመ ፡ ትፍሥሕትክሙ ፡ ፍጽምተ ፡ ትኩ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ን ፡ ላለው ፡ ወዘንተ ፡ እነግር ፡ ለዓለም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመ ፡ ፍሥሐየ ፡ ይኩን ፡ ፍጹመ ፡ በላዕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሌሆሙ ፡ ሲል ፡ የሰማናት ፡ ትምህርት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህች ፡ ናት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወንዜንወክሙ ፡ ከመ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ ብርሃን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውእቱ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(በብርሃን ፡ እንጅ ፡ በጨለማ ፡ የሚሠራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውን ፡ አያውቅም ፡ ላሉት) ፡ ጻድቅ ፡ ምእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መን ፡ ዕውቀት ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወጽልመትሰ ፡ አልቦ ፡ ኀቤሁ ፡ ወኢአሐቲኒ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኃጢአት ፡ ድንቁርና ፡ ግን ፡ በሱ ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥቂትስ ፡ እንኳ ፡ (አሐቲኒ) ፡ አንድ ፡ ወገ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንስ ፡ እንኳ ፡ እንደሌለበት ፡ እንነግራች",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኋለን ፡ መዝ ፡ ፻፴ ፥ ፪ ። ዮሐ ፡ ፰ ፥ ፲፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": "፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፮ ፤ ወእመሰ ፡ ብነ ፡ ሱታፌ ፡ ምስሌሁ ፡ ንቤለክሙ፤⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከእሱ ፡ ጋራ ፡ አንድነት ፡ አለን ፡ ብንላችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወውስተ ፡ ጽልመት ፡ ነሐውር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኛ ፡ ግን ፡ ወደ ፡ ኃጢአት ፡ ወደ ፡ ክህ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደት ፡ ብንሄድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ንሔሱ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐሰት ፡ እንናገራለን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢንገብራ ፡ ለጽድቅ ፡ ወለርትዕ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽድቅ ፡ ርትዕንም ፡ አንሠራትም ፡ ም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ፥ ፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": "፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፯ ፤ ወእመሰ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ብርሃን ፡ ነሐውር ፡ በከመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውእቱ ፡ ብርሃን ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሱ ፡ ጻድቅ ፡ ምእመን ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ በሃ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይማኖት ፡ በጽድቅ ፡ ብንኖር ፡ ግን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ሱቱፋን ፡ ንሕነ ፡ በበይናቲነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁላችን ፡ ከእሱ ፡ ጋራ ፡ አንድ ፡ ነን፡ ወደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሙ ፡ ለኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡ ማንሻ ፡ አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ (ወንዜንወክሙ ፡ ብለህ ፡ መልስ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(እመሰ ፡ ንቤለክሙ)፡ ከእሱ ፡ ጋራ ፡ አንድ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነን ፡ ብንላችሁ ፡ (ወውስተ ፡ ጽልመት) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሱን ፡ አላዋቂ ፡ ብንለው ፡ ሐሰት ፡ እንናገራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለን ፡ ጽድቅ ፡ ርትዕንም ፡ አንሠራትም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሱ ፡ ዐዋቂ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ እንደ ፡ መሆኑ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዐዋቂ ፡ ብንለው ፡ ግን ፡ እርስ ፡ በርሳ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ችን ፡ አንድ ፡ ሁነን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወደሙ ፡ ለኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡ ያነጽሐነ ፡ እምኵሎን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኃጣውኢነ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡ ሥጋው ፡ ደሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከኃጢአታችን ፡ ያነጻናል ። ሐተታ ፡ ም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ የምንነጻ ፡ በጥምቀት ፡ አይደለም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
